loop r = if r < 1 then 0 else if False then loop (r - 1) else fst (head [(7, 0)])
main = loop (if Uniform < 0.5 then 2 else 1)
-- The discrete twin of known-issues/decreasingRecursionRefusedAsGenerateFallback:
-- an enumerated argument into a recursion whose call has a decreasing
-- argument (loop (r - 1)). Both arguments take the final else, so main is 7.
-- Docs task decreasing-recursion-refused-as-generate-fallback.
